sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant TX as Queue transaction
  participant O as sms_outbox
  participant W as Immediate/minutely worker
  participant P as Twilio

  TX->>O: Insert unique queued message
  TX-->>TX: Commit visit/event/outbox together
  W->>O: Claim due row FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
  O-->>W: status=sending, attempt_count++, 5-minute lease
  W->>O: Check opt-out/rate limit; renew fenced claim
  W->>P: POST SMS (20-second timeout)
  alt provider rejects or call throws
    W->>O: failed + exponential next_attempt_at; dead at attempt 8
  else provider accepts and local update succeeds
    P-->>W: provider message ID
    W->>O: sent + provider_message_id + sent_at
  else provider may accept but response/local write is lost
    Note over W,O: Ambiguous external effect
    W->>O: Row may remain failed/sending and later be reclaimed
    Note over W,P: Duplicate SMS is possible; no exactly-once guarantee
  end
